=\"true\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-dark=\"\"></span><span><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Chapter </span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">one</span></span></p><h3 id=\"how-we-met-title\" class=\"bd-stopcard__title\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">How we met</span></h3><div class=\"bd-prose\"><p><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">We met at Allison and Jamie’s wedding.</span></p><p><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Flirty glances across the room, and an immediate connection.</span></p><div class=\"placeholder\" data-placeholder=\"true\" role=\"note\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span class=\"placeholder__label\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Sara + Tyler are still writing this:</span></span> <p class=\"placeholder__hint\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">the rest of the story — who noticed whom first, what was said, and what happened after the last dance.</span></p></div></div><p class=\"bd-prov bd-prov--own\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">From Sara + Tyler</span></p></div><span class=\"bd-stopcard__numeral\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"--d: 0.0000;\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">1</span></span></article></div></li><li id=\"the-connection\" class=\"bd-ride__stop\" data-kind=\"transfer\" data-line=\"blue\" style=\"--i:1\" data-state=\"ahead\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-near=\"\"><div class=\"bd-ride__platform\"><article class=\"bd-stopcard bd-stopcard--chapter\" aria-labelledby=\"the-connection-title\" data-bl-k=\"article\" data-bl-label=\"The connection\"><div class=\"bd-stopcard__text\" style=\"--d: 1.0000;\"><p class=\"bd-stopcard__meta\"><span class=\"bd-stopcard__bullet\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-dark=\"\"></span><span><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Chapter </span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"label\">two</span></span></p><h3 id=\"the-connection-title\" class=\"bd-stopcard__title\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">The connection</span></h3><div class=\"bd-prose\"><p><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Best friendship. Peace. Becoming better together.</span></p><p><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Those are Tyler’s words for what this is, and they are the seed of everything on this page.</span></p><div class=\"placeholder\" data-placeholder=\"true\" role=\"note\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span class=\"placeholder__label\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Sara + Tyler are still writing this:</span></span> <p class=\"placeholder__hint\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">the story of how the connection became a relationship, in your own words.</span></p></div></div><p class=\"bd-prov bd-prov--own\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">From Sara + Tyler</span></p></div><span class=\"bd-stopcard__numeral\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"--d: 1.0000;\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">2</span></span></article></div></li><li id=\"our-life-together\" class=\"bd-ride__stop\" data-kind=\"transfer\" data-line=\"brown\" style=\"--i:2\" data-state=\"ahead\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"bd-ride__platform\"><article class=\"bd-stopcard bd-stopcard--chapter\" aria-labelledby=\"our-life-together-title\"><div class=\"bd-stopcard__text\" style=\"--d: -1.0005;\"><p class=\"bd-stopcard__meta\"><span class=\"bd-stopcard__bullet\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Chapter </span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"label\">three</span></span></p><h3 id=\"our-life-together-title\" class=\"bd-stopcard__title\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Our life together</span></h3><div class=\"bd-prose\"><p><span data-bl-t=\"label\">The places that shaped us: the Museum of Ice Cream, Richardson Farm, Michael Jordan’s Steakhouse, food tastings, gardening together, the Madison waterfront, and Starved Rock.</span></p><p><span data-bl-t=\"label\">You can wander through them on Our Adventures, and borrow a few for your own weekend on Share an Adventure.</span></p><div class=\"placeholder\" data-placeholder=\"true\" role=\"note\"><span class=\"placeholder__label\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Sara + Tyler are still writing this:</span></span> <p class=\"placeholder__hint\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">which adventures to t